abstract: "A comprehensive open research monorepo containing architectural blueprints, threat models, mathematical formulations, and engineering specifications for embedded, distributed, and privacy-preserving IoT Intrusion Detection Systems. Encompasses three progressive research tracks: Mini-IDS (Generation 1 baseline with low-latency C/libpcap capture), BF-IDS (Generation 2 distributed hybrid with Isolation Forest behavioral fingerprinting and ESP32 satellite sniffers), and PPFL-IoT-IDS (Generation 3 privacy-preserving federated learning)."
